<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  Protein inference results in mzIdentML 1.2 (hand-written test file for reading protein groups, issue #1105):
  - PAG_1: annotated as in the 1.2 guidelines: B and A are indistinguishable leading proteins (B is the group
    representative), C is a non-leading sub-set protein; group probability on the PAG; cluster 1.
  - PAG_2: the single leading protein D; cluster 1 (shares peptide PEP_2 with A and B).
  - PAG_3: without leading/non-leading annotation (as in mzIdentML 1.1 files): E and F have the same peptides,
    G a sub-set of them; the group does not pass the threshold.
-->
